{
 "__doc__": [
  "docs/PF_VITAL_NAMES.json - the project's SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for Pirate Force wire (Vital) id -> class name.",
  "ตารางชื่อ vital ของโปรเจกต์ - ที่เก็บชื่อ 'ที่เดียว' ห้ามมีตารางชื่อคู่ขนานที่อื่น",
  "",
  "(1) WHAT THIS FILE IS / ไฟล์นี้คืออะไร",
  "    Every 16-bit Vital wire id the project has a plaintext name for lives here, and only here.",
  "    Any tool, server, test or document that needs an id->name mapping must read THIS file.",
  "    ทุกที่ในโปรเจกต์ที่ต้องแปลง id -> ชื่อ ให้อ่านไฟล์นี้",
  "",
  "(2) COVERAGE / ขอบเขต",
  "    This table is a strict superset of the NAMES dict inside the frozen delivery snapshot",
  "    current/pf_login_game_server_v141.py: all 49 of its entries are reproduced here verbatim,",
  "    plus 3 ids that v141 decoded as bare hex and that PF-NAMEID-RESOLVE-001 resolved from the",
  "    read-only client binary:",
  "      0x1B40 -> LogoutVital                    (id-slot 0x108207C)",
  "      0x36DB -> DeleteActorVital               (id-slot 0x1081FD0)",
  "      0xAC52 -> Channel_LocalTalkMessageVital  (id-slot 0x1084458)",
  "    Each of the three carries a literal->slot evidence pointer in its 'evidence' field.",
  "",
  "(3) WHY v141 IS NOT EDITED / ทำไมห้ามแก้ v141",
  "    current/pf_login_game_server_v141.py is a FROZEN DELIVERY SNAPSHOT written by the previous",
  "    AI (Codex): a from-scratch server derived by reverse-engineering the client. It is NOT raw",
  "    evidence and it is NOT 'the original server' - the original server was never published and",
  "    has been shut down for years. Its one remaining job is to be the reference we diff the",
  "    rewrite against, so that we can tell whether we have drifted. That comparison is only",
  "    meaningful if the snapshot never moves. That - not evidentiary status - is why it is",
  "    byte-frozen (sha256 guard in tools/verify_hypothesis_ledger.py).",
  "    v141 = สมุดทดลองของ Codex ที่แช่แข็งไว้เป็น 'ตัวเทียบว่า rewrite ไม่หลงทาง'",
  "    ไม่ใช่หลักฐานดิบ และไม่ใช่ 'original server' - ห้ามแก้แม้แต่ไบต์เดียว",
  "    Raw evidence (read-only forever) = GameClient/GameClient.local.bin + capture_v141/.",
  "",
  "(4) HOW TO ADD A NEW NAME / จะเพิ่มชื่อใหม่ทำยังไง",
  "    ADD IT HERE. ONLY HERE. Never in v141, never in a second table.",
  "    เพิ่มที่ไฟล์นี้เท่านั้น ห้ามเติมใน v141 (แม้จะดูเป็นที่ที่ 'เคยชิน')",
  "    A new entry is admissible only when BOTH hold:",
  "      (a) HASH MATCH - wire_id(name) == id under the round-62 algorithm in hash_algorithm below.",
  "          tests/test_vital_names_table.py enforces this on every entry, so a wrong name is red",
  "          immediately.",
  "      (b) LITERAL -> SLOT EVIDENCE - the name exists as a unique identifier-style string literal",
  "          in GameClient/GameClient.local.bin, and the single push of that literal sits in the",
  "          round-62 registration thunk (push <lit>; call 0x89C080; mov ecx,eax; call 0x89BD00;",
  "          mov word ptr [<id-slot>], ax; ret). Record that id-slot VA in 'id_slot_va' and cite",
  "          the finding document in 'evidence'.",
  "    Names inherited from v141 are grandfathered: their evidence pointer is the v141 NAMES entry",
  "    itself, and they still have to pass the hash check.",
  "",
  "GUARDS / ยาม",
  "    tests/test_vital_names_table.py  - table superset-of-v141, name agreement, hash of every entry",
  "    tools/pf_vital_id_resolve_static.py - reads this file as primary, cross-checks against v141",
  "                                          and against the client binary + golden corpus"
 ],
 "schema": 1,
 "hash_algorithm": {
  "summary": "uint16 id = ( sum over i of (signed char)name[i] * (i+1) ) mod 2^16",
  "pseudocode": [
   "s = 0",
   "for i, byte in enumerate(name.encode('latin1')):",
   "    c = byte - 256 if byte >= 128 else byte     # movsx di, byte -> signed char",
   "    s += c * (i + 1)                            # imul di, bx    -> 1-based index",
   "return s & 0xFFFF                               # mov ax, dx; ret 4"
  ],
  "settled_by": "PF-NAMEID-HASH-001 (round 62, commit 7c66b21)",
  "reference_impl": "tools/pf_vital_id_resolve_static.py :: wire_id()",
  "verifiers": [
   "tools/pf_vital_id_hash_static.py",
   "tools/pf_vital_id_resolve_static.py"
  ]
 },
 "frozen_snapshot": {
  "path": "current/pf_login_game_server_v141.py",
  "role": "frozen delivery snapshot / comparison reference only - NOT raw evidence, NOT the original server",
  "mutable": false,
  "names_symbol": "NAMES",
  "names_entry_count": 49,
  "byte_freeze_guard": "tools/verify_hypothesis_ledger.py (IMMUTABLE_V141_PATH sha256)"
 },
